Type: Package
Package: bioRtools
Title: Reproducible Analysis-to-Figure Workflows for Omics Data
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Xiang", "LI", , "lixiang117423@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a reproducible analysis-to-figure contract for
    multivariate omics workflows. Core methods preserve native statistical
    model objects while returning validated score, loading, diversity, VIP,
    and differential-result tables together with composable 'ggplot2'
    figures. The package includes microbiome ordination and diversity
    workflows, metabolomics multivariate models, transcriptomic and
    microbiome differential analysis, functional enrichment, and reusable
    publication-oriented plotting helpers.
